/E (Hey Unitians, I'm Adhav, and I'm the latest in the long line of Editors-in-Chief of The Eagle's Eye newsletter! I first came aboard The Eagle's Eye in the year 2020 after being given the opportunity to bring my talents to the magazine. I have only managed to discover my passion for writing through the issues. It has been an enjoyable journey, helping to design the covers, writing articles, editing the articles with others, and getting a hold of volumes we have worked hard on. )
