/E (Regardless of viewpoints, the need for compassion toward those who have been convicted along with their families grows among Singaporeans. The relatives of prisoners who are fighting some of the strictest anti-drug laws in the world are being supported by many activists who are working against the clock to bring an end to such executions. However it is to be said protesting in Singapore is not very welcomed either, and is also very much an offence.t)
/Pg 11 0 R
