/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 71 0 R
/T (The case of Nagaenthran K. Dharmalingam brought attention back to Singapore's death penalty. Before his execution on April 27, the Malaysian drug courier, who had an IQ of 69, had spent more than ten years on death row. At Hong Lim Park, the only location in the nation where Singaporeans can demonstrate without a police permit, hundreds gathered twice in April in a rare display of public solidarity. A petition seeking Mr Nagaenthran's release had received more than 100,000 signatures and many individuals on social media protesting the death penalty and Singapore's drug campaign. However, on the contrary, there were a few who supported the ruling, calling for his death. Many believed that crimes should be harsh as offenders should face the consequences of their crimes and that making them harsh would scare others from committing the same sins. Realistically speaking, the death penalty is also more affordable than having to keep yet another prisoner alive for many years under captivity. Despite all the efforts made by protest, he was scheduled to be hanged on 10 November 2021.)
/E (The case of Nagaenthran K. Dharmalingam brought attention back to Singapore's death penalty. Before his execution on April 27, the Malaysian drug courier, who had an IQ of 69, had spent more than ten years on death row. At Hong Lim Park, the only location in the nation where Singaporeans can demonstrate without a police permit, hundreds gathered twice in April in a rare display of public solidarity. A petition seeking Mr Nagaenthran's release had received more than 100,000 signatures and many individuals on social media protesting the death penalty and Singapore's drug campaign. However, on the contrary, there were a few who supported the ruling, calling for his death. Many believed that crimes should be harsh as offenders should face the consequences of their crimes and that making them harsh would scare others from committing the same sins. Realistically speaking, the death penalty is also more affordable than having to keep yet another prisoner alive for many years under captivity. Despite all the efforts made by protest, he was scheduled to be hanged on 10 November 2021.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [2]
>>
