/T (Such topics remain very touchy and controversial. What are your views on this? Do you think such laws are ethical? Personally, I lean towards the abolishment of compulsory death sentences, light offenders/special offenders should have slightly more leeway with somewhat lighter punishments for smaller offences. Those who commit bigger offences deserve harsher punishments. Such extremes should be purely situational and decided fairly. )
/E (Such topics remain very touchy and controversial. What are your views on this? Do you think such laws are ethical? Personally, I lean towards the abolishment of compulsory death sentences, light offenders/special offenders should have slightly more leeway with somewhat lighter punishments for smaller offences. Those who commit bigger offences deserve harsher punishments. Such extremes should be purely situational and decided fairly. )
/Pg 12 0 R
