/P 72 0 R
/T (A judicial panel was held with three judges to hear the case. Eventually, the judges ruled in favour of Roe, but the case became one of the most controversial cases in the US. After five decades, on the 24th of June this year, The Republican-backed Mississippi legislation that the US Supreme Court upheld outlaws abortions beyond 15 weeks. Astonishingly, within the same day, Roe v. Wade was overruled by a 5-4 decision on the same day.)
